  "content": "\n\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_945056aa-921e-44e4-85dd-f45231940861.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/potionstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bce6dd3-7af5-4014-a705-04cd0c0adb87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zQA4eez2eS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2e3d72d9-91b0-4d00-8eef-26be28254a6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f_AOCAWOL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84597b2e-8453-472a-9043-329d8218ac75.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>「你的頭腦中有智慧，你的雙腳踏著鞋。你可以朝任何你選擇的方向前行。</em>&nbsp;<em>你必須獨自面對。你知道你所知道的。而「你」將是決定去向何方的那個人」</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>—蘇斯博士，《Oh, The Places You'll Go!》</em>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_a1820aba-6e98-496b-954b-53c078297080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"71\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_f80168f8-5c01-42cf-a924-b36e91cafca5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"101\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-descent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_7acdccbe-8e6f-49f6-bde2-ee820d4370a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"596\" height=\"68\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_10da38ee-7e1c-4d1d-9bf5-d07267b232ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"116\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\">《Oh The Biomes We've Gone》是經典模組《Oh The Biomes You'll Go》的續作，適用於 1.20+ 版本，內含超過 50 個令人屏息、充滿魔力且寫實的生態域。BWG 將透過為我的世界注入豐富多樣且細緻的生命元素，帶你展開一場冒險。BWG 還新增了獨特的生物、建築結構以及數百種可供利用的方塊。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43d7961e-7fe6-4cab-9073-f96e1a05c5bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"793\" height=\"416\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找 1.19 及更低版本的支援嗎？請前往<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">《Oh The Biomes You'll Go》</span>！</p>",
